conversation_before_the_call.text:
{
  "message": "I can help with disputing those charges. To access and file disputes on your cards I first need to verify your identity (we must confirm 2 of: date of birth, email, phone number, or address). Please tell me which identifier you'd like me to use to look up your account so we can start verification: a) User ID, b) Email address, or c) Full name (case-sensitive). After I look up your account I will ask you to confirm two of the four identity fields and then log the verification. \n\nAlso, to prepare the disputes, please provide for each card the specific transaction(s) you want to dispute: merchant name, transaction date, amount, and whether you’re marking it as fraud/unauthorized or another type of problem. Example: \"Gold Rewards — $123.45 at Example Store on 2026-09-12 — fraud.\"\n\nIf you’d rather speak with a human at any point, tell me and I can transfer you, but I can try to help first.",
  "next_actions": [
    "Choose an identifier to look up your account: user ID, email, or full name (case-sensitive).",
    "List the specific transactions for each card you want disputed (merchant, date, amount, reason)."
  ]
}
